
@startuml
title Biometric Authentication - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
actor User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "Biometric SDK\n(Fingerprint / Face ID)" as Bio
participant "Backend API" as API
database "User Database" as DB

User -> App: Open application
App -> API: Request authentication challenge
API -> API: Generate nonce / challenge
API --> App: Return challenge

App -> Bio: Request biometric authentication
Bio -> User: Prompt for fingerprint / face
User -> Bio: Provide biometric input

alt Biometric verification successful
    Bio --> App: Authentication success
    App -> App: Sign challenge using device key
    App -> API: Submit challenge + signature
    API -> DB: Retrieve registered public key
    DB --> API: Return public key
    API -> API: Verify signature and challenge

    alt Signature valid
        API --> App: Authentication success + token
        App --> User: Grant access
    else Signature invalid
        API --> App: Authentication failed
        App --> User: Deny access
    end

else Biometric verification failed
    Bio --> App: Authentication failure
    App --> User: Show error / retry
end

@enduml
